==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|á||in, at}} and {{m|is|morgunn||tomorrow}}.

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[tomorrow]]
#: ''Eigum við að hittast '''á morgun'''?''
#:: Shall we meet '''tomorrow'''?

